Provenance and third-party assets
=================================

The research workflow was adapted from Andrej Karpathy's autoresearch method at
commit 228791fb499afffb54b46200aca536f79142f117. No upstream Python source was
copied from that project. The pinned KellerJordan/Muon optimizer is an external
dependency, not vendored source. PyTorch, NumPy, FlashAttention, DeepGEMM,
Triton, QuACK, and other installed or referenced projects retain their own
licenses; no license is granted here for those external projects.

Third-party assets are not relicensed by this distribution:

- tokenizer/tokenizer-65k.json is a derived tokenizer artifact identified in
  tokenizer/tokenizer-65k-freeze.md as licensed by Sarvam AI under the Sarvam
  AI Research License. It is not an official Sarvam product.
- data/tokenizer/rwkv-7-world/rwkv_vocab_v20230424.txt is from BlinkDL/RWKV-LM
  (RWKV-v7/rwkv_vocab_v20230424.txt), pinned at commit
  aeda8a06fc4803655473c7e7359b1d7166e2c604. Upstream terms apply:
